{"version":1,"key":"card:486","content":{"id":486,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Rust 作为强静态类型语言，必须在编译时就知道所有变量的类型。最简单的办法在声明变量的同时指定其类型"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"fn main() {\n    let i: i32 = -1;\n    let u: u32 = 2;\n\n    println!(\"{} {}\", i, u);\n}","language":"rs","uuid":"db92e771-afb6-428f-8678-b02d20f34aaa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"fn main() {\n    let i = 1_i32; // i32\n    let u = 2_u32; // u32\n\n    println!(\"{} {}\", i, u);\n}","language":"rs","uuid":"6773f1c8-eb6a-4076-8f51-a77c5bb270b0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这样略显繁琐，好在大部分情况下不需要手动指定类型，Rust 编译器可根据值自动推断出变量类型"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"struct Point {\n    x: i32,\n    y: i32,\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    // let p: Point = Point {x: 1, y: }\n    let p = Point { x: 1, y: 2 }; // Point\n}","language":"rs","uuid":"30fb75de-ec28-4f77-8120-dd80c9fc0687","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"tip","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于数字类型，如果没有显示标注类型，也无法根据其上下文确定其类型，那么整数默认为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"i32","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，浮点数默认为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"f64","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"更神奇的是，Rust 可以根据变量的使用来确定变量的类型"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"fn sum(a: u32, b: u32) -> u32 {\n    a + b\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    let a = 1; // u32\n    let b = 2; // u32\n    println!(\"{}\", sum(a, b));\n}","language":"rs","uuid":"d701e64e-a4e8-400b-82a5-86f450354219","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上述 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"a","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"b","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 定义未声明类型，但是由于它们是作为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"sum","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 函数的参数使用，而其参数声明的类型是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"u32","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以二者的类型被推导为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"u32","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 了。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"fn main() {\n    let mut vec: Vec<u32> = vec![];\n    let a = 1;\n    let b = 2;\n    \n    vec.push(a);\n    vec.push(b);\n}","language":"rs","uuid":"8b821b42-522e-400e-bb11-fdbdb29ac344","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上述 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"a","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"b","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 同样在定义时未声明类型，但是它们后面被插入到了类型为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Vec<u32>","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的向量中，于是它们的类型就被推导为了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"u32","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果无法根据上下文确定其类型，那么变量在声明时一定要标注类型"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"fn main() {\n    let str_num = \"32\";\n\n    let num = str_num.parse().unwrap();\n\n    println!(\"{}\", num);\n}","language":"rs","uuid":"da01d387-0514-485c-ba98-7c8938f1d68b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"let num = str_num.parse().unwrap();\n    ^^^           ----- type must be known at this point\n  = note: cannot satisfy `<_ as FromStr>::Err == _`\nhelp: consider giving `num` an explicit type\n\nlet num: /* Type */ = str_num.parse().unwrap();","language":"rs","uuid":"b652fcf7-6632-4062-b542-af130fc1d474","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上述将一个字符串转化为数字，Rust 编译器无法推导其类型，需要显示的标注，对于上述程序有两种办法"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"let num: u32 = str_num.parse().unwrap();","language":"rs","uuid":"15891e00-0bb3-4934-b377-9213d2696c80","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"let num = str_num.parse::<u32>().unwrap();","language":"rs","uuid":"72243fb1-b73c-4c49-b139-810ab1be6655","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["Rust"],"createTime":1721091346443,"updateTime":1755938841137,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1755938841137}}